        "text_eppAFe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Earth Harbor began in the heart of my off-the-grid treehouse kitchen—the tiny, sustainable home where my husband and I lived while embracing a mindful lifestyle. But the journey to Earth Harbor wasn’t a straightforward one.<\/p>",
