            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "spacing_bottom": 12
          }
        },
        "text_MDcqy3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>After a near-fatal car accident left me disabled, I found myself facing both physical and mental challenges that reshaped how I viewed health, healing, and the way we care for ourselves. At a time when recovery felt impossible, I discovered I was pregnant with my miracle baby boy. These life-altering experiences made me rethink everything, especially the products I was using on my body and their impact on the planet. I knew I had to take clean living to the next level.<\/p>",
            "size": 100,
            "text_position": "center",
            "spacing_bottom": 12
          }
        }
      },
