        },
        "text_GqLtmz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Frustrated by the lack of skincare that met my strict standards—effective, science-rooted, natural, ethical, sustainable, safe for sensitive skin, and versatile enough for everyday life—I decided to create my own. Many natural products lacked the rigorous testing and long-term stability needed to ensure both safety and efficacy. I wanted skincare that delivered real results and was simple enough to fit seamlessly into daily routines. Working out of my little treehouse kitchen, I blended marine botanicals and plant-based ingredients, putting a decade of home herbalism practice and my graduate degree in toxicology to work crafting formulas that reflected my vision.<\/p>",
            "size": 100,
            "text_position": "center",
            "spacing_bottom": 12
          }
        }
      },
