        "text_jbUHwr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Starting Earth Harbor was both exhilarating and daunting. With just $2,000 I had worked hard to save, no outside connections, and student loans still looming, I began selling my first products at local farmers’ markets. Those early days were a labor of love, built on determination and the belief that skincare should do more than feel good—it should make a real difference.<\/p>",
