        "text_UfnaKd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>What started as a small dream has grown into something far greater than I ever imagined. Earth Harbor remains a completely self-funded and grassroots small family business, a testament to the fact that the world truly wanted what we had to offer: proven, plant-based skincare that’s ethical, joyful, and impactful—for both your skin and the planet.<\/p>",
